<title>USA: Municipal sales to total $665 mln for Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Municipal sales to total $665 mln for Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive and negotiated municipal bond sales for Wednesday are expected to total $665 million in 31 offerings, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>Competitive sales total $126 million in 19 issues.</p>
<p>Negotiated sales total $539 million in 12 offerings.</p>
<p>An additional $32 million of deals in two offerings are on the possible negotiated calendar, meaning underwriters have said they may price the deals Wednesday depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
</text>
